| desc = [[Break]] sources applied to the unit disables its corresponding Spirit Link ability.
}}

 * This ability only affects the caster and the caster's {{H|Spirit Bear}}, and does not affect any other {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}.

* {{Symbol|bonus ls}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
*** {{hi|Lone Druid}} {{to}} {{hi|Spirit Bear}}
***# Lone Druid's attack instance.
***# The attack instance applies a [[lifesteal]]-based heal to the Spirit Bear.
*** {{hi|Spirit Bear}} {{to}} {{hi|Lone Druid}}
***# The Spirit Bear's attack instance.
***# The attack instance applies a lifesteal-based heal to the Lone Druid.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Spirit Link icon0}}
| desc = Links Lone Druid and the Spirit Bear, increasing their movement speed as well as sharing a percentage of their lifesteal with each other.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The visual effect upon leveling up only appears when the {{H|Spirit Bear}} is {{Code|≤ 1500}}-distance of Lone Druid.

